  prayer: {
    zh: '主啊，我知道诱惑很少猛然出现，它总是一步步地引诱我。求你帮助我在平日就与你的智慧亲近，把你的话刻在心里，像保守眼中的瞳人一样保守它——好让那声音在关键时刻先响起。求你让我看清自己习惯走近的“街角”，给我勇气改走一条不同的路。当“不会有人知道”“只此一次”的话术响起时，帮助我认出它、不被它牵走。也求你替我把镜头快进，让我在还站在起点时，就看见那条路真正的尽头。谢谢你差人对我说真话，也谢谢你随时愿意帮助我转身。阿们。',
    en: 'Lord, I know temptation rarely strikes all at once; it leads me step by step. Help me stay close to your wisdom in ordinary days, to write your word on my heart and guard it like the apple of my eye — so that voice sounds first in the decisive moment. Show me the “corners” I habitually approach, and give me courage to take a different road. When the lines “no one will know” and “just this once” start to speak, help me recognize them and not be led away. Fast-forward the tape for me, that while I’m still at the start I would see where the road truly ends. Thank you for sending people who tell me the truth, and thank you that you are always willing to help me turn back. Amen.',
  },

